  "description": "现代化伤害系统：把原版战斗重做成「伤害乘区」体系。26 种攻击与防御附魔、MDS 合成台、可配置战斗面板、40 个成就，以及敌对生物的附魔适配；移除跳劈必暴击。\\n\\nModern Damage System rebuilds combat around a damage-multiplier system: 26 attack and defense enchantments, an MDS crafting station, a configurable combat HUD, 40 achievements and enchanted hostile mobs. The jump-crit rule is gone.\\n\\nCurseForge: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-damage-system\\nSource: https://github.com/JuzipiAN/modern-damage-system",
